{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々のブログになってしまいましたが\n今週の『NOGIBINGO!』観ましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちー様はもちろん\nみんなかっこ良かった～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にアイドルの男装好きな\n中田得な企画でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/28/3113737/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、先週出演していた\n『NOGI ROOM』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は出てないけど\nお手紙を書かせていただきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までいろんなメンバーに書いてきたけど\nずっと書きたかったメンバーなので\n熱がこもってしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/28/3113737/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、先週とあわせて\nHuluでチェックしてね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、\n『BOMBER-E』の公開収録がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中で新曲の\n『ブランコ』を初披露させていただきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、12thシングルぶりに\nアンダーフロントです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/28/3113737/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、センターの隣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この位置は初めて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言うならば、おいシャンぶりです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、選抜とアンダーで全然違うけども"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『BOMBER-E』の放送\n楽しみにしててね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/28/3113737/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな16thアンダーメンバーですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『Merry Xmas Show 2016』\nの開催が決まりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は選抜とアンダーには別れて\n2日ずつやらせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/28/3113737/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年とか一昨年とか\nアンダーライブと全体のライブ\n4公演分も覚えなきゃいけなくて\n必死だったから\n今回は余裕もって楽しんでできるかなーっ\nと期待してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーフロント\n見逃さないようにね、中田推しは来てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/28/3113737/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は沈金！\n行ってきまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/28/3113737/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}